                    <details>These six benchmarks were derived from volume EM reconstructions of C. elegans, Fly brain, HeLa cell, Glycolytic muscle, Salivary gland, and a known neuronal benchmark, Lucchi++ . The widely heterogenous mitochondria in these benchmarks together serve as a stringent evaluation of deep learning based, or other, segmentation approaches.</details>
